  "description": "Application for certificate of Lawfulness in respect of  proposed development consists of the installation of a single electric vehicle charging unit for a mobility scooter within an existing designated underground parking space serving a residential flat. The works include the mounting of a small-scale charging unit (a post-mounted) and the installation of associated electrical cabling connected to the existing electricity supply (power room). All works are minor in nature and confined to the existing parking area. There are no alterations to the building structure, external dimensions, or layout of the site. The proposal does not involve the creation or alteration of access, the formation of new hardstanding, changes to drainage, or the construction of any means of enclosure. The siting and approximate dimensions of the charging unit are indicated on the submitted plans.",
